window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In a small modern day little village of Ingleton, the family of Wilsons have always had a reputation. Living in a huge manor overlooking the town full of history, they are also well known for being a family of witches, reaching back to the 1600s. When a thick fog lays over the village and begins to spread across the neighbouring towns and cities, bringing the undead and spirits of the underworlds with it, it is up to the Wilson witches, Rosie, Alice, and Carolyn, led by their beloved elderly grandmother Rosalyn, they are the only ones who can stop the world from falling into a ghostly apocalypse.</p> <p>In this fast-burning thriller, immerse yourself into the story of how Matilda Brittle, the ancestor of the Wilsons, created a sigil for revenge and the intention to spread her vengeance to destroy the world. It is only Rosie, Carolyn, and Alice that are the ones who can stop it from happening.</p> <p>If you loved <i>Practical Magic</i> and <i>The Witches of Vardo</i>, with a sprinkle of inspiration from <i>Charmed </i>and <i>The Craft</i>, you will fall in love with this strong female-lead adult fantasy fiction, taking you on an emotional rollercoaster until the very end.</p>"; 
